  "description": "The PLCcom library is a highly performant and optimized component especially designed for .net-Developer to access data provided by a Siemens PLC in the most comfortable way. With PLCcom for S7 you can read and write data from a PLC with ease. Try it right away: with blank license fields the library runs with full functionality for 15 minutes during a debugging session. For uninterrupted work, generate a free trial license (14 days) at https://www.indi-an.com/en/plccom/for-s7/fors7-download/",
